bruhatOrder -- computes the Bruhat order on a generalized flag variety
**********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        P = bruhatOrder(X)
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note GKM variety: GKMVariety,, a generalized flag variety or
        Schubert variety
  * Outputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: (Posets)Poset,, the Bruhat
        order

Description
===========

Given a *note GKMVariety: GKMVariety, $X$ created by either *note
generalizedFlagVariety: generalizedFlagVariety, or *note
generalizedSchubertVariety: generalizedSchubertVariety,, computes and returns
the Bruhat order corresponding to the Bruhat decomposition.  The resulting
poset is cached in $X$, and can be accessed by either *note cellOrder:
cellOrder, or *note bruhatOrder: bruhatOrder,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Fl3 = generalizedFlagVariety("A",2,{1,2})                   |
|                                                                 |
|o1 = a GKM variety with an action of a 3-dimensional torus       |
|                                                                 |
|o1 : GKMVariety                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : cellOrder Fl3                                               |
|stdio:2:1:(3): error:  no cell order defined on this moment graph|
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : P = bruhatOrder Fl3                                         |
|                                                                 |
|o2 = P                                                           |
|                                                                 |
|o2 : Poset                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : #(coveringRelations P) == 8                                 |
|                                                                 |
|o3 = true                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : cellOrder Fl3                                               |
|                                                                 |
|o4 = P                                                           |
|                                                                 |
|o4 : Poset                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

