The "forgetful" map from the complete flag variety $Fl(4)$ to $Gr(2,4)$, given
by forgetting the subpsaces in the complete flag except for the 2-dimensional
one, can be created as a *note EquivariantMap: EquivariantMap, by the method
*note flagMap: flagMap,.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : Fl4 = generalizedFlagVariety("A",3,{1,2,3},Gr24.characterRing) --Fl(4) |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = a "GKM variety" with an action of a 4-dimensional torus                |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : GKMVariety                                                             |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|with the torus having the same character ring as Gr24                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : f = flagMap(Fl4,Gr24)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = an "equivariant map" of GKM varieties                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o12 : EquivariantMap                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : Fl4 === f.source and Gr24 === f.target                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

As $Fl(4)$ is a $BiProj$ of vector bundles on $Gr(2,4)$, the (derived)
pushforward of the structure sheaf of $Fl(4)$ is the structure sheaf of
$Gr(2,4)$ since the higher direct images vanish under the forgetful map.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : (trivialKClass Gr24) === (pushforward f)(trivialKClass Fl4)|
|                                                                 |
|o14 = true                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------+

