    GKM variety
  * *note projectiveSpace: projectiveSpace, -- constructs projective space as a
    GKM variety
  * *note normalToricVariety:
    (NormalToricVarieties)normalToricVariety_lpList_cmList_rp, -- make a normal
    toric variety
