generalizedSchubertVariety -- create a generalized Schubert variety
*******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        Y = generalizedSchubertVariety(X,pt)
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note GKM variety: GKMVariety,, obtained by *note
        generalizedFlagVariety: generalizedFlagVariety,
      * pt, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, an element in X.points
  * Outputs:
      * Y, a *note GKM variety: GKMVariety,, the generalized Schubert variety
        corresponding to pt which is the union of all Bruhat cells
