Description
===========

This method creates a *note GKMVariety: GKMVariety, that represent a
generalized Schubert variety of a generalized flag variety. The following
example is the Schubert variety of projective lines in $\mathbb P^3$ meeting a
distinguished point.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = generalizedSchubertVariety(generalizedFlagVariety("A",3,{2}),{set{0,|
|                                                                             |
|o1 = a "GKM variety" with an action of a 4-dimensional torus                 |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : GKMVariety                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|3}})                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

