product is $X \times Y$ with the structure of a GKM variety given by the
diagonal action of $T$. This method constructs $X \times Y$ as a *note
GKMVariety: GKMVariety,. To speed up computation, this method does not
automatically cache the moment graph of $X \times Y$. The user can cache this
using the method *note MomentGraph ** MomentGraph: MomentGraph _st_st
