KClass -- the class of all equivariant K-classes
************************************************

Description
===========

For $X$ a GKM variety with an action of a torus $T$ whose character ring is
$R$, a $T$-equivariant $K$-class $C \in K_T^0(X)$ of is encoded by its image in
$K_T^0(X^T) = \prod_{x\in X^T} R$, under the injective restriction map
$K_T^0(X) \to K_T^0(X^T)$. See [Corollary 5.12; VV03] or [Corollary A.5; RK03]
for details.



A *note KClass: KClass, C is a *note HashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,
consisting of two keys:

  * variety, whose value is a *note GKMVariety: GKMVariety, of which C is a
    K-class of
  * KPolynomials, whose value is a *note HashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,;
    its keys are X.points and the values are Laurent polynomials in the
    character ring representing the values of the K-class under the restriction
    map.





See also
========

  * *note makeKClass: makeKClass, -- constructs an equivariant K-class
  * *note isWellDefined(KClass): isWellDefined_lpKClass_rp, -- whether the
    input is a well-defined equivariant K-class
  * *note pushforward: pushforward, -- computes the pushforward map of
    equivariant K-classes of an equivariant map
  * *note pullback(EquivariantMap): pullback_lpEquivariantMap_rp, -- computes
    the pullback map of equivariant K-classes of an equivariant map
  * *note euler(KClass): euler_lpKClass_rp, -- computes the equivariant Euler
    characteristic of an equivariant K-class

Functions and methods returning an equivariant K-class:
=======================================================

  * "ampleKClass(GKMVariety)" -- see *note ampleKClass: ampleKClass, -- the
    class of an ample line bundle
  * "makeKClass(GKMVariety,List)" -- see *note makeKClass: makeKClass, --
    constructs an equivariant K-class
  * *note makeKClass(GKMVariety,FlagMatroid):
    makeKClass_lpGKMVariety_cmFlagMatroid_rp, -- the equivariant K-class of a
    flag matroid
  * *note makeKClass(GKMVariety,ToricDivisor):
    makeKClass_lpGKMVariety_cmToricDivisor_rp, -- create the KClass from a
    ToricDivisor
  * "orbitClosure(GKMVariety,Matrix)" -- see *note orbitClosure: orbitClosure,
    -- computes the equivariant K-class of a torus orbit closure of a point in
