|                                                                             |
|o3 : KClass                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : peek O2                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = KClass{variety => a "GKM variety" with an action of a 4-dimensional     |
|                                                       2 2                   |
|            KPolynomials => HashTable{{set {0, 1}} => T T }                  |
|                                                       0 1                   |
|                                                       2 2                   |
|                                      {set {0, 2}} => T T                    |
|                                                       0 2                   |
|                                                       2 2                   |
|                                      {set {0, 3}} => T T                    |
