    flag matroid
  * *note euler(KClass): euler_lpKClass_rp, -- computes the equivariant Euler
    characteristic of an equivariant K-class

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note latticePoints(FlagMatroid): latticePoints_lpFlagMatroid_rp, --
    lattice points of a base polytope of a flag matroid
