========

  * *note isWellDefined(KClass): isWellDefined_lpKClass_rp, -- whether the
    input is a well-defined equivariant K-class
  * *note KClass * KClass: KClass _st KClass, -- computes the product of two
    equivariant K-classes
  * *note KClass + KClass: KClass + KClass, -- computes the sum of two
    equivariant K-classes
  * *note pullback(EquivariantMap): pullback_lpEquivariantMap_rp, -- computes
    the pullback map of equivariant K-classes of an equivariant map
  * *note pushforward: pushforward, -- computes the pushforward map of
    equivariant K-classes of an equivariant map

