makeKClass(GKMVariety,ToricDivisor) -- create the KClass from a ToricDivisor
****************************************************************************

  * Function: *note makeKClass: makeKClass,
  * Usage: 
        C = makeKClass(X,D)
  * Inputs:
      * X, a *note GKM variety: GKMVariety,, created from a *note
        NormalToricVariety: (NormalToricVarieties)NormalToricVariety,
      * D, a *note toric divisor: (NormalToricVarieties)ToricDivisor,, 
  * Outputs:
      * C, an *note equivariant K-class: KClass,, 

Description
===========

If a GKM variety $X$ also admits a structure of a *note NormalToricVariety:
(NormalToricVarieties)NormalToricVariety,, then the following example shows how
to obtain the *note KClass: KClass, of any *note ToricDivisor:
(NormalToricVarieties)ToricDivisor, on $X$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = toricProjectiveSpace 3;                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = toricDivisor({1,0,0,0},X) -- the class of O(1) on P^3               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = X                                                                       |
|      0                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : ToricDivisor on X                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Y = makeGKMVariety X; -- The torus is C^3 not C^4                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = makeKClass(Y,D)                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = an "equivariant K-class" on a GKM variety                               |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : KClass                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : assert(isWellDefined C)                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : peek C                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = KClass{variety => a "GKM variety" with an action of a 3-dimensional     |
|                                                    -1                       |
|            KPolynomials => HashTable{{0, 1, 2} => T  }                      |
|                                                    2                        |
|                                                    -1                       |
|                                      {0, 1, 3} => T                         |
|                                                    1                        |
|                                                    -1                       |
|                                      {0, 2, 3} => T                         |
|                                                    0                        |
|                                      {1, 2, 3} => 1                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|torus}                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

Toric vector bundles are yet to be imported.

