  * *note KClass: KClass, -- the class of all equivariant K-classes
  * *note normalToricVariety(GKMVariety): normalToricVariety_lpGKMVariety_rp,
    -- converts a GKM variety back into a toric variety
  * *note makeGKMVariety(NormalToricVariety): makeGKMVariety, -- constructs a
    GKM variety

