momentGraph -- creates a moment graph
*************************************

  * Usage: 
        G = momentGraph(L,E,H)
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of vertices
      * E, a *note hash table: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable,, whose keys are lists
        of two vertices representing edges and values are characters of
        corresponding 1-dimensional orbits
      * H, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, a polynomial ring representing
        the equivariant cohomology ring of a point
  * Outputs:
      * G, a *note moment graph: MomentGraph,, 

Description
===========

This method creates a *note MomentGraph: MomentGraph, from the data of
vertices, edges and their associated characters, and a ring representing the
equivariant cohomology ring of a point (with trivial torus-action). The
following example is the moment graph of the projective 2-space $\mathbb P^2$.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : V = {set{0}, set{1}, set{2}};                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : E = hashTable {({set{0},set{1}},{-1,1,0}), ({set{0},set{2}},{-1,0,1}),  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = HashTable{{set {0}, set {1}} => {-1, 1, 0}}                             |
|               {set {0}, set {2}} => {-1, 0, 1}                              |
|               {set {1}, set {2}} => {0, -1, 1}                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : HashTable                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|({set{1},set{2}},{0,-1,1})}                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : t = symbol t; H = QQ[t_0..t_2]                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = H                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : G = momentGraph(V,E,H)                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = a "moment graph" on 3 vertices with 3 edges                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : MomentGraph                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : peek G                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = MomentGraph{cache => CacheTable{}                               }       |
|                 edges => HashTable{{set {0}, set {1}} => {-1, 1, 0}}        |
